---
description: PostgreSQL access via packages/db and Drizzle. Use when touching schema, queries, or migrations.
globs:
  - packages/db/**
  - **/schema.ts
  - **/drizzle/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# Drizzle / Postgres

- All DB access goes through `packages/db`. Do not query Postgres ad hoc from random apps.
- Match existing Drizzle schema, relations, and migration style.
- Validate at persistence boundaries (Zod). Do not trust raw JSON from the client.
- Hocuspocus persists Yjs in Postgres — follow that package’s existing persistence code.
